BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: TorontoBabel Language Exchange
UID:event_317055896@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052759Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T230000
SUMMARY:Halloween Pub Crawl & Social Event @ Artful Dodger Pub by Toronto 
 Babel
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n🎃
 👻 **HALLOWEEN NIGHT PUB CRAWL – OCTOBER 31** 🦇🍻\n\nHey friends!
  Get your Halloween plans started with Toronto Babel and our **3rd Annual 
 Babelween Pub Craw**l! 🎃 Join us for a fun evening of drinks\, food\, a
 nd socializing before heading out to experience the Halloween vibes on Chu
 rch Street! 👻🕸️\n\n🎟️ **FREE EVENT — Everyone is welcome!**
 \n\n📍 **Location:** Artful Dodger Pub - 2nd Floor\n🏠 10 Isabella St.
 \, Toronto\, ON M4Y 1N1\n🕕 **6:00 PM – 9:00 PM:** Pre-drinks\, food &
  socializing 🍻🍔\n🎃 **9:00 PM onwards:** Halloween walk on Church 
 Street!\n\nCome hang out\, meet new people\, grab a drink\, and enjoy the 
 Halloween atmosphere with the Babel crew. At 9 PM\, you're welcome to join
  us for a walk along Church Street to check out the amazing costumes and f
 estivities — or head off to your own Halloween parties and plans!\n\n
 🧛‍♀️ **Costumes are encouraged!** Come dressed up and bring your 
 Halloween spirit!\n\n💬🫶🌟 Pull up solo or bring a friend — eithe
 r way\, you'll leave with new connections\, good laughs\, and even better 
 vibes!\n\n🤝 **Community Guidelines & Safe Space Policy**\nToronto Babel
  is a welcoming and safe space for everyone. Harassment\, discrimination\,
  and inappropriate behavior will not be tolerated. If you experience or wi
 tness any issues\, please inform one of the organizers so we can address t
 hem appropriately. Let's keep our community fun\, respectful\, and inclusi
 ve for all! ❤️\n\n🌐 **Stay Connected with Toronto Babel!**\n\n📅 
 **Meetup & RSVP:** [https://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar](https:/
 /www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar)\n\n👥 **Facebook Group:** [https
 ://www.facebook.com/groups/torontobabel](https://www.facebook.com/groups/t
 orontobabel)\n\n💬 **WhatsApp Group:** [https://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw
 8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7](https://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7)\n\n
 📸 **Instagram:** [https://www.instagram.com/t.o.babel](https://www.inst
 agram.com/t.o.babel)\n\n🎃 See you there\, Babel crew! Let's make this H
 alloween one to remember! 🥂👻\n\n#TorontoBabel #TorontoEvents #Toront
 oNightlife #HalloweenToronto #HalloweenPubCrawl #ChurchStreet #LanguageExc
 hange #MakeNewFriends #MeetLearnShare #TorontoHalloween
